# Allowlist build context (ARCHITECTURE §3, ARCHITECTURE_OPS §13): exclude everything, then re-include only what the
# image needs. The Dockerfile copies only these paths. tests/infra/test_dockerignore.py proves that the credential
# files, data/, docs/planning/ and .env* never enter the context.
#
# Docker applies the LAST matching line, so the re-excludes at the bottom win over the includes above them.
# Comments must start a line: Docker reads "foo # note" as the pattern "foo # note".
*

!pyproject.toml
!requirements.lock
!src/restaurantos/**
!src/web/**
!config/**
!scripts/build_phrase_cache.py

# Never shipped, even from inside an allowlisted folder.
src/web/node_modules
src/web/dist
src/web/.vite
src/web/coverage
src/web/test-results
src/web/playwright-report
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Credentials and local env files, wherever they appear.
**/meta_muse_api_key
**/twilio_credentials
**/elevenlabs_api_key
**/fly_token
**/*_credentials
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
